@MovieApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5233

### GET all movies (tom lista första gången)
GET {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies
Accept: application/json

###

### POST — skapa en film
POST {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "genre": "Science fiction",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "releaseYear": 2016,
  "durationMinutes": 116,
  "rating": 8.0,
  "description": "En språkvetare försöker kommunicera med besökare från rymden."
}

###

### POST — en till
POST {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner 2049",
  "genre": "Science fiction",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "releaseYear": 2017,
  "durationMinutes": 164,
  "rating": 8.1,
  "description": "En ny blade runner upptäcker en hemlighet som kan förändra allt."
}

###

### GET by id — finns
GET {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/1
Accept: application/json

###

### GET by id — finns inte (404)
GET {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/9999
Accept: application/json

###

### PUT — uppdatera film med id 1
PUT {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Arrival (Director's Cut)",
  "genre": "Science fiction",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "releaseYear": 2016,
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "rating": 8.5,
  "description": "Uppdaterad beskrivning."
}

###

### PUT — id mismatch (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Fel id i body",
  "genre": "Test",
  "director": "Test",
  "releaseYear": 2000,
  "durationMinutes": 100,
  "rating": 5.0
}

###

### DELETE — ta bort film med id 2
DELETE {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/2

###

### DELETE — finns inte (404)
DELETE {{MovieApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/9999
